(6299342, 933113, 69487, '<td valign="top">Well exposed, fits the title.  Photographically great, not so interesting to me.</td>', 'Well exposed, fits the title.  Photographically great, not so interesting to me.', '2011-02-01 02:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6299343, 930396, 69487, '<td valign="top">Very cute, well focused and exposed.  Processing seems to have gone wrong.  If you are not seeing the splotches of grey around the background then its your monitor hiding them.  At the right angle its obvious (optimal to low) and Optimal to High on bad LCD''s like the worse of my two when it inverts u can see everything.  But a a certain point you miss it, hope this doesn''t hurt your score but people will spot things as it will not show the same on every monitor.  Especially a calibrated one.</td>', 'Very cute, well focused and exposed.  Processing seems to have gone wrong.  If you are not seeing the splotches of grey around the background then its your monitor hiding them.  At the right angle its obvious (optimal to low) and Optimal to High on bad LCD''s like the worse of my two when it inverts u can see everything.  But a a certain point you miss it, hope this doesn''t hurt your score but people will spot things as it will not show the same on every monitor.  Especially a calibrated one.', '2011-02-01 02:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6299344, 932046, 69487, '<td valign="top">I have plenty of these to do this with on occasion.  Real question from me is how you did your water spread to look as nice as it does, just chance?</td>', 'I have plenty of these to do this with on occasion.  Real question from me is how you did your water spread to look as nice as it does, just chance?', '2011-02-01 02:55:15.000000', NULL, 1),
