(6302144, 932380, 108580, '<td valign="top">Another beautiful early morning shot with ghostlike subjects and the obligatory empty park bench. I''ve seen another one on DPC not so far back that also gave me the shivers. Great image.</td>', 'Another beautiful early morning shot with ghostlike subjects and the obligatory empty park bench. I''ve seen another one on DPC not so far back that also gave me the shivers. Great image.', '2011-02-03 14:23:06.000000', NULL, 1),
