(6302243, 933013, 101702, '<td valign="top">Looks a bit blurry to the left edge. I also think this may have been a better shot if it was looking more "along" the building line towards the chimney. That way there would be a lead in line to the chimney rather than just cutting across the frame.</td>', 'Looks a bit blurry to the left edge. I also think this may have been a better shot if it was looking more "along" the building line towards the chimney. That way there would be a lead in line to the chimney rather than just cutting across the frame.', '2011-02-03 17:13:50.000000', NULL, 1),
