(6302452, 932824, 113419, '<td valign="top">beautiful horses; nice shot; my only bit of advise (although I know shooting horses isn''t easy) it would have been a better shot had there been some space between the two horses - even the sorrels legs are barely visible, it''s almost as if there is a second horse growing out of the side of the first one</td>', 'beautiful horses; nice shot; my only bit of advise (although I know shooting horses isn''t easy) it would have been a better shot had there been some space between the two horses - even the sorrels legs are barely visible, it''s almost as if there is a second horse growing out of the side of the first one', '2011-02-03 23:07:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6302454, 931028, 113419, '<td valign="top">beautiful catch!</td>', 'beautiful catch!', '2011-02-03 23:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
