(6302457, 931734, 113419, '<td valign="top">great shot; I do have one suggestion though; your model should have been moved over to the right (looking at the picture) so that the line in floor isn''t cutting her in half</td>', 'great shot; I do have one suggestion though; your model should have been moved over to the right (looking at the picture) so that the line in floor isn''t cutting her in half', '2011-02-03 23:15:13.000000', NULL, 1),
