(6302926, 932127, 86218, '<td valign="top">Man o man. Such a strong mood BUT I wish this was framed better. To much in view and the essence of this scene lies in the lower halve - bottom 2/3. The plot is lost going into the clouds beyond the shadowed tree line. Less would have been more here. Pano would have suited this. Th elast line of trees is as far ones eye should trail in this. You witnesed a special day here. Still a very nice photo and being overley critical, but for such a lovely opportunity one needs to be. 7</td>', 'Man o man. Such a strong mood BUT I wish this was framed better. To much in view and the essence of this scene lies in the lower halve - bottom 2/3. The plot is lost going into the clouds beyond the shadowed tree line. Less would have been more here. Pano would have suited this. Th elast line of trees is as far ones eye should trail in this. You witnesed a special day here. Still a very nice photo and being overley critical, but for such a lovely opportunity one needs to be. 7', '2011-02-04 15:05:58.000000', NULL, 1),
