(6304343, 932999, 30364, '<td valign="top">Two fairly similar trees studies in this challenge, and both of them very good.  For me, yours has the slight advantage, though I guess the other might score higher.  I think it''s the horizontal layering that I prefer.  Plus it''s B&amp;W which I''m a sucker for.  Thank you.</td>', 'Two fairly similar trees studies in this challenge, and both of them very good.  For me, yours has the slight advantage, though I guess the other might score higher.  I think it''s the horizontal layering that I prefer.  Plus it''s B&W which I''m a sucker for.  Thank you.', '2011-02-06 15:00:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6304344, 928758, 30364, '<td valign="top">Like a fierce ink drawing blotted into reluctant cohesion with a damp sponge.  I like it very much.  Thank you.</td>', 'Like a fierce ink drawing blotted into reluctant cohesion with a damp sponge.  I like it very much.  Thank you.', '2011-02-06 15:04:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6304348, 933091, 56502, '<td valign="top">Her look is priceless!</td>', 'Her look is priceless!', '2011-02-06 15:07:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6304353, 930122, 30364, '<td valign="top">A giant faux-moon, a humanoid perfectly intersected by an urban skyline, a tortured tree and a massive, crushing crucifix.  And on top of all that a marvelous title to tease all the parts into a coherent plait. I could easily be reading far more into this than you may have intended, but I suspect not.   I just love it.  Top three for me.  Thank you.</td>', 'A giant faux-moon, a humanoid perfectly intersected by an urban skyline, a tortured tree and a massive, crushing crucifix.  And on top of all that a marvelous title to tease all the parts into a coherent plait. I could easily be reading far more into this than you may have intended, but I suspect not.   I just love it.  Top three for me.  Thank you.', '2011-02-06 15:11:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6304355, 933130, 30364, '<td valign="top">Poor Janice.  I''ll bet she feels just like Alice.  I love the colours, tones and voluptuous shapes.  Top three for me.  Thank you.</td>', 'Poor Janice.  I''ll bet she feels just like Alice.  I love the colours, tones and voluptuous shapes.  Top three for me.  Thank you.', '2011-02-06 15:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6304360, 933115, 30364, '<td valign="top">First I though you should''ve cropped off the bottom part, then I thought, "What the Hell do I know; it''s your picture."  On reflection, I like it very much, just as it is.  The dark void makes the person''s strange body position all the more improbable and thus more wonderful.  Thank you.</td>', 'First I though you should''ve cropped off the bottom part, then I thought, "What the Hell do I know; it''s your picture."  On reflection, I like it very much, just as it is.  The dark void makes the person''s strange body position all the more improbable and thus more wonderful.  Thank you.', '2011-02-06 15:18:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6304365, 930201, 4517, '<td valign="top">Great colours and sky.</td>', 'Great colours and sky.', '2011-02-06 15:27:35.000000', NULL, 1),
