(6305034, 928777, 67258, '<td valign="top">Lovely light on the robin, but you have done something really strange in the processing, I think.  Initially I noticed that the bird appeared to have no feet, which made me look closer - I assume you have added blur in p-p to give a shallow depth of field appearance.  The trouble is, it defies logic. Hmm, or maybe there is a bit of an optical illusion going on, and the robin is much closer to the camera than the fence.  Either way, doesn''t quite work for me.</td>', 'Lovely light on the robin, but you have done something really strange in the processing, I think.  Initially I noticed that the bird appeared to have no feet, which made me look closer - I assume you have added blur in p-p to give a shallow depth of field appearance.  The trouble is, it defies logic. Hmm, or maybe there is a bit of an optical illusion going on, and the robin is much closer to the camera than the fence.  Either way, doesn''t quite work for me.', '2011-02-07 08:16:09.000000', NULL, 1),
