(6305376, 930902, 83313, '<td valign="top">Grog teaches youngling to hunt. First Grog gives youngling knife to kill prey. Youngling looks at Grog. Then Grog gives youngling bow to kill prey. Youngling looks at Grog. Grog says: "Hmmm", and Grog thinks. (Is very hard work for Grog)<br/> <br/>Grog teaches youngling to stare at prey and kill with boredom. YES! Grog has success!  Grog is great teacher of skills!</td>', 'Grog teaches youngling to hunt. First Grog gives youngling knife to kill prey. Youngling looks at Grog. Then Grog gives youngling bow to kill prey. Youngling looks at Grog. Grog says: "Hmmm", and Grog thinks. (Is very hard work for Grog) Grog teaches youngling to stare at prey and kill with boredom. YES! Grog has success!  Grog is great teacher of skills!', '2011-02-07 13:55:27.000000', NULL, 1),
