(6306218, 933076, 62357, '<td valign="top">Well done Deb.  Nice score, nice placement and faves too.  Very successful FS I say.  And as you say, you can always shoot another sunset!</td>', 'Well done Deb.  Nice score, nice placement and faves too.  Very successful FS I say.  And as you say, you can always shoot another sunset!', '2011-02-08 00:11:10.000000', NULL, 0),
