(6306313, 932866, 68504, '<td valign="top">I rather like this for the exuberance of colours, and that wing is full of grace.  Many people take perfect hummingbird pics - they set up with feeders and whatall.  I have done what you have done, only with dragonflies: sometimes waiting for them to come into my prefocus (camera beeps), or, better, using manual focus on my 70-300 zoom but also waiting for the camera to beep.  I think of it as a sport.</td>', 'I rather like this for the exuberance of colours, and that wing is full of grace.  Many people take perfect hummingbird pics - they set up with feeders and whatall.  I have done what you have done, only with dragonflies: sometimes waiting for them to come into my prefocus (camera beeps), or, better, using manual focus on my 70-300 zoom but also waiting for the camera to beep.  I think of it as a sport.', '2011-02-08 00:58:25.000000', NULL, 0),
