(6306332, 932681, 54645, '<td valign="top">Well, I''m honored to have slapped you with your only 9! A wonderful example of the world around us if we just stop. Cliche, I know, but it''s relevant. I found this image to also share that special vision that Brian <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=76335" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">bvy</a> often displays in seemingly random photographs of mundane subjects. Not only do we frequently walk blind, but we are blinded by the inability to see a photograph such as this when it''s glowing right in front of our face.</td>', 'Well, I''m honored to have slapped you with your only 9! A wonderful example of the world around us if we just stop. Cliche, I know, but it''s relevant. I found this image to also share that special vision that Brian  bvy often displays in seemingly random photographs of mundane subjects. Not only do we frequently walk blind, but we are blinded by the inability to see a photograph such as this when it''s glowing right in front of our face.', '2011-02-08 01:07:40.000000', NULL, 0),
