(6306359, 933065, 93565, '<td valign="top">This was one of my favorites from the challenge. It''s just... bizarre. I love the ring of light in the ice, the strange prismatic effect that''s going on, the small petal/stick on the aged flower, the branch... pretty much everything. Just a very cool shot. The icicle trailing down, mirroring the stalk, is nice.</td>', 'This was one of my favorites from the challenge. It''s just... bizarre. I love the ring of light in the ice, the strange prismatic effect that''s going on, the small petal/stick on the aged flower, the branch... pretty much everything. Just a very cool shot. The icicle trailing down, mirroring the stalk, is nice.', '2011-02-08 01:21:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(6306360, 932677, 108580, '<td valign="top">Congrats Rian. Hard work pays off! Mooi met die blits links en regs uit die boom uit!</td>', 'Congrats Rian. Hard work pays off! Mooi met die blits links en regs uit die boom uit!', '2011-02-08 01:21:47.000000', NULL, 0),
