(6306362, 932646, 96751, '<td valign="top">Is this that same bit of pavement, only covered with snow?  Amazing range of colors.</td>', 'Is this that same bit of pavement, only covered with snow?  Amazing range of colors.', '2011-02-08 01:22:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(6306363, 932256, 93565, '<td valign="top">I just liked this as soon as I saw it. The curved line of birds leading into the (seeming) spiral is simply great. Nice composition, a welcome change from traditional bird shots, and an example of seizing the moment. Well done.</td>', 'I just liked this as soon as I saw it. The curved line of birds leading into the (seeming) spiral is simply great. Nice composition, a welcome change from traditional bird shots, and an example of seizing the moment. Well done.', '2011-02-08 01:23:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(6306365, 932681, 96751, '<td valign="top">A rippled enigma.  With a tan line.</td>', 'A rippled enigma.  With a tan line.', '2011-02-08 01:23:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(6306366, 932984, 96751, '<td valign="top">Indeed, the colors are splendid.  As are the lines.</td>', 'Indeed, the colors are splendid.  As are the lines.', '2011-02-08 01:24:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(6306367, 932030, 108580, '<td valign="top">Really nicely controlled. Superb vision and justified finish.<br/>Stars have moved a bit thanks to the 41 second s/s. It''s not a bad thing but they are now egg shaped :) I try keep it to 30 seconds no more to keep them round!</td>', 'Really nicely controlled. Superb vision and justified finish.Stars have moved a bit thanks to the 41 second s/s. It''s not a bad thing but they are now egg shaped :) I try keep it to 30 seconds no more to keep them round!', '2011-02-08 01:24:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(6306368, 932280, 93565, '<td valign="top">This seems a bit nontraditional for you; I certainly didn''t expect this was from you, which is neither good nor bad. I like how the reflection is facing the viewer, yet blurred, while the clear and sharp bird is looking away.<br/> <br/>ETA: I see now that it was another bird... I had interpreted it as a reflection, but either way, the repetition works very well.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-02-08 05:35:57.</i></td>', 'This seems a bit nontraditional for you; I certainly didn''t expect this was from you, which is neither good nor bad. I like how the reflection is facing the viewer, yet blurred, while the clear and sharp bird is looking away. ETA: I see now that it was another bird... I had interpreted it as a reflection, but either way, the repetition works very well.', '2011-02-08 01:24:54.000000', '2011-02-08 05:35:57.000000', 0),
(6306370, 928758, 54645, '<td valign="top">What a wonderful image, how many cockatiels do/did you have?</td>', 'What a wonderful image, how many cockatiels do/did you have?', '2011-02-08 01:25:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(6306371, 932716, 96751, '<td valign="top">A fabulous fish abstract.  He really does glow.</td>', 'A fabulous fish abstract.  He really does glow.', '2011-02-08 01:25:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(6306372, 932863, 30214, '<td valign="top">beautiful shot</td>', 'beautiful shot', '2011-02-08 01:25:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(6306374, 933035, 93565, '<td valign="top">This one was really improved by your standing on the pier. It brings the viewer out into the ocean, like an outsider looking in upon the city. I''m a big fan of the overall dark and gloomy feeling of this shot, too.</td>', 'This one was really improved by your standing on the pier. It brings the viewer out into the ocean, like an outsider looking in upon the city. I''m a big fan of the overall dark and gloomy feeling of this shot, too.', '2011-02-08 01:25:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(6306378, 931045, 93565, '<td valign="top">The distortion of the image from the windshield is nice, it adds to the atmosphere, the feeling of drear, the city ennui. Sitting in the car, away from it but never escaping. Nice.</td>', 'The distortion of the image from the windshield is nice, it adds to the atmosphere, the feeling of drear, the city ennui. Sitting in the car, away from it but never escaping. Nice.', '2011-02-08 01:27:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(6306380, 930396, 86218, '<td valign="top">Ditto Melethia. The whites here are perfect for this shot.</td>', 'Ditto Melethia. The whites here are perfect for this shot.', '2011-02-08 01:28:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(6306381, 932001, 69008, '<td valign="top">Wow Julie, the voters must hate millet.    This one don''t have that face grabbing contrast, vivid colors, and tight cropped single subject content that gets the big DPC votes though.   As a birder, I can see what you liked about this photo, and I like it too.</td>', 'Wow Julie, the voters must hate millet.    This one don''t have that face grabbing contrast, vivid colors, and tight cropped single subject content that gets the big DPC votes though.   As a birder, I can see what you liked about this photo, and I like it too.', '2011-02-08 01:28:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(6306382, 933076, 93565, '<td valign="top">I like this one much more than your alternates. It conveys more. The sunsets are pretty, no doubt, but I love this one more. To me, it captures much of the childhood happiness... feeling like you''re flying, with the ocean out below you. And it looks so much like summer! It''s great to have shots like this in the depths of winter. :)</td>', 'I like this one much more than your alternates. It conveys more. The sunsets are pretty, no doubt, but I love this one more. To me, it captures much of the childhood happiness... feeling like you''re flying, with the ocean out below you. And it looks so much like summer! It''s great to have shots like this in the depths of winter. :)', '2011-02-08 01:28:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(6306385, 933073, 96751, '<td valign="top">This is just too wonderful.  A technical mess which by all measures should be a flop, yet it is profound in its wonderfulness.  My heart wants to laugh and cry.  At the same time.</td>', 'This is just too wonderful.  A technical mess which by all measures should be a flop, yet it is profound in its wonderfulness.  My heart wants to laugh and cry.  At the same time.', '2011-02-08 01:29:32.000000', NULL, 0),
(6306386, 930595, 54645, '<td valign="top">Well, believe it or not, I thought of you when this image popped up. I''m was startled to see this as your entry, I believe it was the name that triggered the thought.  Anyway, you have stretched the bounds of child portraiture. Fluctuating focus, light, and depth; creative use of your craft, and certainly a hallmark of your work in general.</td>', 'Well, believe it or not, I thought of you when this image popped up. I''m was startled to see this as your entry, I believe it was the name that triggered the thought.  Anyway, you have stretched the bounds of child portraiture. Fluctuating focus, light, and depth; creative use of your craft, and certainly a hallmark of your work in general.', '2011-02-08 01:29:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(6306388, 931913, 93565, '<td valign="top">The quasi-double exposure just works so wonderfully here. The clouds on the building are...just awesome. The patched light at the bottom almost seems like on a negative. Overall a very interesting image, makes you look into things, take it apart, and experience it yourself- this is much welcomed.</td>', 'The quasi-double exposure just works so wonderfully here. The clouds on the building are...just awesome. The patched light at the bottom almost seems like on a negative. Overall a very interesting image, makes you look into things, take it apart, and experience it yourself- this is much welcomed.', '2011-02-08 01:29:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(6306390, 932962, 96751, '<td valign="top">Goofy ''tude!  Great image.</td>', 'Goofy ''tude!  Great image.', '2011-02-08 01:30:42.000000', NULL, 0),
(6306391, 932280, 86218, '<td valign="top">Ahhhh yes...Paul as well :) Nice shot. Should have recognised your work especially in the pp class. Great work</td>', 'Ahhhh yes...Paul as well :) Nice shot. Should have recognised your work especially in the pp class. Great work', '2011-02-08 01:30:53.000000', NULL, 0),
(6306392, 933130, 93565, '<td valign="top">When I saw this, I was wondering if it was an inversion, or something else. It felt like an ice formation made of dirty motor oil. Weirdness complimented by cracks and weathering, very nice.</td>', 'When I saw this, I was wondering if it was an inversion, or something else. It felt like an ice formation made of dirty motor oil. Weirdness complimented by cracks and weathering, very nice.', '2011-02-08 01:31:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(6306394, 933076, 73056, '<td valign="top">God, I wish life could be that carefree again! Love your title. :) By the way, it''s the Ventura Pier. Congrats on your finish.</td>', 'God, I wish life could be that carefree again! Love your title. :) By the way, it''s the Ventura Pier. Congrats on your finish.', '2011-02-08 01:31:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(6306395, 933115, 96751, '<td valign="top">The stovetop was the warmest spot in the house.  As they sat around, waiting for the potato soup to boil, the vapors produced an enigmatic vision.</td>', 'The stovetop was the warmest spot in the house.  As they sat around, waiting for the potato soup to boil, the vapors produced an enigmatic vision.', '2011-02-08 01:32:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(6306396, 931913, 54645, '<td valign="top">This image is a trip. Gave it an 8 for the ride.</td>', 'This image is a trip. Gave it an 8 for the ride.', '2011-02-08 01:32:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(6306397, 932108, 93565, '<td valign="top">This one is sorta just...odd to look at. It''s not readily obvious initially where it is the water ends. Besides, it''s strange for trees to be growing out of water like that. Really just pulls me into things.</td>', 'This one is sorta just...odd to look at. It''s not readily obvious initially where it is the water ends. Besides, it''s strange for trees to be growing out of water like that. Really just pulls me into things.', '2011-02-08 01:32:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(6306398, 933112, 96751, '<td valign="top">Loving the depth.</td>', 'Loving the depth.', '2011-02-08 01:33:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(6306399, 929482, 54645, '<td valign="top">Well done J. BTW, what is a powder finish? Did you offer her an undercoating as well? ;)</td>', 'Well done J. BTW, what is a powder finish? Did you offer her an undercoating as well? ;)', '2011-02-08 01:35:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(6306400, 931226, 96751, '<td valign="top">I am so in love with this image.  The little birds all facing left.  The eagle facing right.  The blur and poetry, all set against the Belt of Venus.</td>', 'I am so in love with this image.  The little birds all facing left.  The eagle facing right.  The blur and poetry, all set against the Belt of Venus.', '2011-02-08 01:35:46.000000', NULL, 0),
