(6306417, 932127, 108580, '<td valign="top">Congrats on your top 10, just missed out on that HM. I know what Rian says goads true for him and may have made the scene more serene, less angry clouds and sky but I believe it''s balanced the way it is with all the elements. Isn''t photography great!?</td>', 'Congrats on your top 10, just missed out on that HM. I know what Rian says goads true for him and may have made the scene more serene, less angry clouds and sky but I believe it''s balanced the way it is with all the elements. Isn''t photography great!?', '2011-02-08 01:44:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(6306418, 931518, 96751, '<td valign="top">Didn''t you enter this image in another challenge?  It''s really powerful, but seem to remember seeing it somewhere else.</td>', 'Didn''t you enter this image in another challenge?  It''s really powerful, but seem to remember seeing it somewhere else.', '2011-02-08 01:44:50.000000', NULL, 0),
