(6306479, 929706, 61084, '<td valign="top">Really cool shot, but unfortunately panoramic s are not allowed at DPC. It can be confusing since in advanced and expert editing rules you can use multiple exposures. The framing of the exposures can''t change though so shifting the camera to get stitch able images doomed you. Hey, nice photo though and that''s what matters most.</td>', 'Really cool shot, but unfortunately panoramic s are not allowed at DPC. It can be confusing since in advanced and expert editing rules you can use multiple exposures. The framing of the exposures can''t change though so shifting the camera to get stitch able images doomed you. Hey, nice photo though and that''s what matters most.', '2011-02-08 02:54:03.000000', NULL, 0),
