(6306617, 931930, 67697, '<td valign="top">Susan this is amazing!  I''ll keep that apple trick in mind.  :)  Excellent capture.  Congrats on a top 20 in the FS!</td>', 'Susan this is amazing!  I''ll keep that apple trick in mind.  :)  Excellent capture.  Congrats on a top 20 in the FS!', '2011-02-08 09:03:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(6306618, 932860, 67152, '<td valign="top">Fantastic work - one of my highest rated images of the challenge.  My father was a navigator on a B29 in WWII, so this shot has special meaning to me.  I recall getting a tour of one some time ago and thougth I recognized the panel behind the man.</td>', 'Fantastic work - one of my highest rated images of the challenge.  My father was a navigator on a B29 in WWII, so this shot has special meaning to me.  I recall getting a tour of one some time ago and thougth I recognized the panel behind the man.', '2011-02-08 09:04:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(6306620, 933076, 67697, '<td valign="top">Awesome!  I am so happy for you that this was well received.  It really is a magical moment.  Congrats on a good finish in the FS!</td>', 'Awesome!  I am so happy for you that this was well received.  It really is a magical moment.  Congrats on a good finish in the FS!', '2011-02-08 09:05:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(6306626, 931035, 67697, '<td valign="top">Wow Ben, what an awesome response to your shot!  The blur and ghostly figure make this such an intriguing scene.  Congrats on a great finish in the FS!</td>', 'Wow Ben, what an awesome response to your shot!  The blur and ghostly figure make this such an intriguing scene.  Congrats on a great finish in the FS!', '2011-02-08 09:13:35.000000', NULL, 0),
