(6306634, 933106, 61961, '<td valign="top">Beautiful abstract composition, so painterly.<br/>Just left of center near the top there''s a spot where the wave meets the shore that is a natural occurrence but looks like a smudged fingerprint.  It''s odd how it keeps catching my eye!  Anyhow, I really like this photo.</td>', 'Beautiful abstract composition, so painterly.Just left of center near the top there''s a spot where the wave meets the shore that is a natural occurrence but looks like a smudged fingerprint.  It''s odd how it keeps catching my eye!  Anyhow, I really like this photo.', '2011-02-08 09:22:06.000000', NULL, 0),
