(6306663, 933065, 61961, '<td valign="top">Surreal indeed!  I think there''s a similar composition on the cover of a book I have on Surrealism.  Striking "eye."</td>', 'Surreal indeed!  I think there''s a similar composition on the cover of a book I have on Surrealism.  Striking "eye."', '2011-02-08 09:44:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(6306664, 929900, 54446, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by citymars:</b></div><hr/><i> Others seem to like the HDR, but I think it looks unnatural.  Still a striking image and nice to see the "indoor" eye of a such a strong landscape photographer.<br/> <br/>Odd comment about the EXIF; I think many photographers strip it to save on file size. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>For DPC, I always use "Save for web..."  That does strip out most exif data.  But, on some images, the embedded copyright data is sticky.  This is not a rules violation.  It''s a copyright protection.  One has to circumnavigate the protective measures put in place by DPC administration to find the deeply embedded copyright.</td>', 'Originally posted by citymars: Others seem to like the HDR, but I think it looks unnatural.  Still a striking image and nice to see the "indoor" eye of a such a strong landscape photographer. Odd comment about the EXIF; I think many photographers strip it to save on file size.  For DPC, I always use "Save for web..."  That does strip out most exif data.  But, on some images, the embedded copyright data is sticky.  This is not a rules violation.  It''s a copyright protection.  One has to circumnavigate the protective measures put in place by DPC administration to find the deeply embedded copyright.', '2011-02-08 09:46:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(6306665, 933128, 61961, '<td valign="top">Although this is clearly a studio portrait that could almost double as a senior yearbook photo, I thought it was very well done and the model is lovely.  I''m sure she was happy with the results.</td>', 'Although this is clearly a studio portrait that could almost double as a senior yearbook photo, I thought it was very well done and the model is lovely.  I''m sure she was happy with the results.', '2011-02-08 09:46:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(6306666, 932302, 124815, '<td valign="top">Sometimes when I go back at the end of a challenge I keep rediscovering qualities to certain pictures that I did not comment during the voting (although I marked this one high). This photo is timeless. Could be considered a bit muddy, but such are the landscapes sometimes and such were the 19th century depictions of them. You are still in my top 10.</td>', 'Sometimes when I go back at the end of a challenge I keep rediscovering qualities to certain pictures that I did not comment during the voting (although I marked this one high). This photo is timeless. Could be considered a bit muddy, but such are the landscapes sometimes and such were the 19th century depictions of them. You are still in my top 10.', '2011-02-08 09:48:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(6306667, 933060, 61961, '<td valign="top">I admire your handling of the exposure.  What a great chandelier (I assume this hangs overhead).  Where is it, I wonder?</td>', 'I admire your handling of the exposure.  What a great chandelier (I assume this hangs overhead).  Where is it, I wonder?', '2011-02-08 09:49:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(6306668, 931767, 86322, '<td valign="top">I love this photo a lot. The lighting is great and it creates a mood and sentiment incredible and amazing. I think this photo shouldve ended in the top 10. Great job.</td>', 'I love this photo a lot. The lighting is great and it creates a mood and sentiment incredible and amazing. I think this photo shouldve ended in the top 10. Great job.', '2011-02-08 09:51:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(6306670, 932119, 124815, '<td valign="top">Very hard to choose among your choices for this challenge. And with such timeless beauty surrounding you! I think that you have to go to the neighbouring countries to get a cliff, not to mention a mountain but you are doing "just fine"! Your lonely tree and Christmas in My Hometown, to mention just a few, are amazing photos. This one, more modest is still a jewel.</td>', 'Very hard to choose among your choices for this challenge. And with such timeless beauty surrounding you! I think that you have to go to the neighbouring countries to get a cliff, not to mention a mountain but you are doing "just fine"! Your lonely tree and Christmas in My Hometown, to mention just a few, are amazing photos. This one, more modest is still a jewel.', '2011-02-08 09:57:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(6306673, 932065, 61961, '<td valign="top">Congrats on breaking in to a top ten dominated by landscapes!</td>', 'Congrats on breaking in to a top ten dominated by landscapes!', '2011-02-08 10:00:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(6306681, 931045, 61961, '<td valign="top">Cell phone, really?  I guess that''s a tribute to your eye (as well as to Motorola), to see this and recognize how good it is.</td>', 'Cell phone, really?  I guess that''s a tribute to your eye (as well as to Motorola), to see this and recognize how good it is.', '2011-02-08 10:02:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(6306690, 932083, 124815, '<td valign="top">This challenge had a lot of great photos and yours got an 8 from me. Of course that it brought me in mind Anna Karenina ...., but I spared you of my fantasies. I would have reduced the sky a little for a more ominous look.</td>', 'This challenge had a lot of great photos and yours got an 8 from me. Of course that it brought me in mind Anna Karenina ...., but I spared you of my fantasies. I would have reduced the sky a little for a more ominous look.', '2011-02-08 10:07:01.000000', NULL, 0),
