(6306742, 931226, 67844, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the positive comments. I entered this because I thought it was interesting and was curious if anyone would see that it was in fact sharpened noise that gives it this look. I did not expect it to do well, but just felt it was something that would be appreciated by a few, and it seems that it was.</td>', 'Thanks for all the positive comments. I entered this because I thought it was interesting and was curious if anyone would see that it was in fact sharpened noise that gives it this look. I did not expect it to do well, but just felt it was something that would be appreciated by a few, and it seems that it was.', '2011-02-08 10:58:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(6306746, 930595, 96751, '<td valign="top">You have a gift of adding an edge to even the most innocent of images.  So powerful.</td>', 'You have a gift of adding an edge to even the most innocent of images.  So powerful.', '2011-02-08 11:02:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(6306750, 932710, 124815, '<td valign="top">I hope that by the time people go back to see the results of this challenge they will realize how under appreciated was this portrait. Must be some ill spell with it because even I  tried to make this comment twice and did not appear so, I try again!<br/>The picture is almost Bergmanesque, there could be an entire film script inspired by it. I still think of it in the top 10 and I place it in my favorites. You got an average of 8 from the 6 commenters and that''s a very nice harvest though, unless I miss some mathematical facts.</td>', 'I hope that by the time people go back to see the results of this challenge they will realize how under appreciated was this portrait. Must be some ill spell with it because even I  tried to make this comment twice and did not appear so, I try again!The picture is almost Bergmanesque, there could be an entire film script inspired by it. I still think of it in the top 10 and I place it in my favorites. You got an average of 8 from the 6 commenters and that''s a very nice harvest though, unless I miss some mathematical facts.', '2011-02-08 11:14:33.000000', NULL, 0),
