(6306831, 932578, 101702, '<td valign="top">This was my highest scoring image, so I''m pleased you won the blue. However, reading your description I fear you may have fallen foul of <br/> <br/>You may not: use ANY editing technique to create new image area, objects or features (such as lens flare or motion) that didnt already exist in your original capture(s).<br/> <br/>I guess we will know soon enough seeing. Fingers crossed!</td>', 'This was my highest scoring image, so I''m pleased you won the blue. However, reading your description I fear you may have fallen foul of  You may not: use ANY editing technique to create new image area, objects or features (such as lens flare or motion) that didnt already exist in your original capture(s). I guess we will know soon enough seeing. Fingers crossed!', '2011-02-08 13:07:25.000000', NULL, 0),
