(6306984, 932681, 76335, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the nod, Ben, and thanks for this image, ubique. Not surprisingly it was one of my top picks. I stared at it for a good long time trying to find words, but if they don''t come, I don''t force it. I enjoyed getting lost in it -- noticing different things about it at different times. What better thing can an image offer?</td>', 'Thanks for the nod, Ben, and thanks for this image, ubique. Not surprisingly it was one of my top picks. I stared at it for a good long time trying to find words, but if they don''t come, I don''t force it. I enjoyed getting lost in it -- noticing different things about it at different times. What better thing can an image offer?', '2011-02-08 17:22:48.000000', NULL, 0),
