(6307031, 931230, 43156, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Yo_Spiff:</b></div><hr/><i> Oh, wow, this is very cool looking. A great feeling of dimension and action to this. Judging from the apparent location and the discussion in the scores thread, I''ve got a fair guess this is a <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21_N.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=30982" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Melethia</a> shot. If it''s not, then make sure to take that as a compliment. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thank you, Steve. I''m taking it as a compliment.</td>', 'Originally posted by Yo_Spiff: Oh, wow, this is very cool looking. A great feeling of dimension and action to this. Judging from the apparent location and the discussion in the scores thread, I''ve got a fair guess this is a  Melethia shot. If it''s not, then make sure to take that as a compliment.   Thank you, Steve. I''m taking it as a compliment.', '2011-02-08 18:38:51.000000', NULL, 0),
