(6315721, 932578, 51638, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by ytshuva:</b></div><hr/><i> it looks like this site quncil could use a little bit of common sense here..what crime have I done? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I understand your frustration and I still think you have produced a wonderful image, however I see no reason for you to question the SC''s common sense. The advanced editing rules couldn''t be any more clear. Using PP to introduce <u>motion</u> (not just blur) is mentioned specifically.</td>', 'Originally posted by ytshuva: it looks like this site quncil could use a little bit of common sense here..what crime have I done?   I understand your frustration and I still think you have produced a wonderful image, however I see no reason for you to question the SC''s common sense. The advanced editing rules couldn''t be any more clear. Using PP to introduce motion (not just blur) is mentioned specifically.', '2011-02-15 20:30:14.000000', NULL, 0),
