(6415930, 932277, 117474, '<td valign="top">This is a nice self portrait. I like the composition and the execution and lighting. <br/>Not sure what else to say about it really. I do think that if it was cropped by the bottom of the sleeve on your right hand and a little outside your arms it would have worked better for me. <br/>It certainly pops well which is nice. <br/>I''m not sure if I have any helpful critique/suggestions/anything else. Though your right hand does look a little blue to me...</td>', 'This is a nice self portrait. I like the composition and the execution and lighting. Not sure what else to say about it really. I do think that if it was cropped by the bottom of the sleeve on your right hand and a little outside your arms it would have worked better for me. It certainly pops well which is nice. I''m not sure if I have any helpful critique/suggestions/anything else. Though your right hand does look a little blue to me...', '2011-05-17 15:03:43.000000', NULL, 0),
