(6919896, 932277, 10785, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the <b>Comment Bomb Squad!</b> <br/> <br/>In your self portrait series, you have a great ability to show and capture your emotion. That is often hard for a guy and I am envious of that. Here the lighting is nice and dramatic with lots of shadows and it appears to be your signature style.  The placement of the hand, the eyes and mouth slightly dropping show a certain vulnerability. Nice job!</td>', 'Greetings from the Comment Bomb Squad!  In your self portrait series, you have a great ability to show and capture your emotion. That is often hard for a guy and I am envious of that. Here the lighting is nice and dramatic with lots of shadows and it appears to be your signature style.  The placement of the hand, the eyes and mouth slightly dropping show a certain vulnerability. Nice job!', '2012-12-02 19:50:42.000000', NULL, 0),
